# The app writes user data into whatever folder the user picks. If that folder
# happens to be a clone of this repo, none of it may ever be committed: it
# holds the learner's own voice, their writing and their conversations. This
# is settings.json and every folder in DATA_DIRS (js/storage.js), and
# test/gitignore.test.mjs fails if a folder is added there and not here.
settings.json
decks/
audio/
shadowing/
voice/
reading/
writing/
conversation/
*.wav
*.mp3
.env

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/

# Working notes, not part of the app.
practice-mode-port.md
